(must have been taking steroids when i wasn't looking) and, for lack
of any other containers, have decided to use it as my stashing box for
now.

So I dump all my gear in there and it suddenly occurs to me- will my
potions be all right in there, or will they freeze and shatter? I
decided to test this with a !oInvisibility and it survived in there
just fine. (Only a few turns, admittedly.) Would longer exposure to
the freezer destroy my potions? If not, should it?

